!!! oculus/hello.mat
!!! The smallest runnable Oculus page.
!!!
!!! This page exists only to prove the build and run contract for the Oculus
!!! desktop system: it compiles as a Matrix book against Anomalous's shared Ny
!!! runtime and runs on nyinterpreter. The session shell, compositor, window
!!! manager and appearance layer arrive in later units (see roadmap.md).

book oculus.hello

main returns number begin paragraph
    say "Oculus: hello from the shared Anomalous runtime"
    give 0
end paragraph
